{"id":"99d86fa29fbc789f","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-wellfounded-rank.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive3 Wellfounded Rank","display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-wellfounded-rank — ZFC Descriptive3 Wellfounded Rank","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-wellfounded-rank","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive3-wellfounded-rank"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-wellfounded-rank — ZFC Descriptive3 Wellfounded Rank","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-wellfounded-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-wellfounded-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive3-wellfounded-rank — ZFC Descriptive3 Wellfounded Rank"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md\">../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,\\rho\\in V\">\\(R,\\rho\\in V\\)</span> (binary relation and rank-function candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fld}(R)\">\\(\\operatorname{fld}(R)\\)</span> (field of a relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\)</span> (well-foundedness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md\">../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WellfoundedRank}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WellfoundedRank}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}rank} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WellfoundedRank}_S(R,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(R,\\operatorname{fld}(R))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,\\operatorname{fld}(R),\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho))\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{fld}(R)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho(x))\\land\\rho(x)=\\bigcup\\{\\rho(y)\\cup\\{\\rho(y)\\}:y\\in\\operatorname{fld}(R)\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}rank} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WellfoundedRank}_S(R,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(R,\\operatorname{fld}(R))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,\\operatorname{fld}(R),\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho))\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{fld}(R)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho(x))\\land\\rho(x)=\\bigcup\\{\\rho(y)\\cup\\{\\rho(y)\\}:y\\in\\operatorname{fld}(R)\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The range is a set of ordinals rather than the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>, and all upstream symbols use their exact signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S$ (well-foundedness predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,\\rho\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fld}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WellfoundedRank}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}rank} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WellfoundedRank}_S(R,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(R,\\operatorname{fld}(R))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,\\operatorname{fld}(R),\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho))\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{fld}(R)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho(x))\\land\\rho(x)=\\bigcup\\{\\rho(y)\\cup\\{\\rho(y)\\}:y\\in\\operatorname{fld}(R)\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false}],"bytes":1574,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1835","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-wellfounded-rank.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive3-wellfounded-rank]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9e70b896da231f4f","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2"]}